// Specs: Uses the AlgorithmApp shell with SELECTION_INPUT + DESIGN_DIFF_OUTPUT windows (WithoutCoord) or VEC_INPUT + SELECTION_INPUT + DESIGN_DIFF_OUTPUT windows (WithCoord).
